{"strongs": "H5633", "word": "סֶ֫רֶן", "translit": "se.ren", "root": "סרן", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "tyrant, lord", "definition": "I. [ סֶ֫רֶן ] 21 noun masculine tyrant, lord (Philistine loan-word); — plural absolute הַסְּרָנִים Judg 16:30 + 2 t.; construct סַרְנֵי Judg 3:3 + 16 t.; suffix סַרְנֵיכֶם 1Sam 6:4 — only of tyrants, lords of the Philistines, five in number Judg 3:3 ; Josh 13:3 ( D ), 1Sam 6:16 ; 1Sam 6:18 compare v 1Sam 6:4 , i.e. apparently, one ruling each of the five cities (named 1Sam 6:17 ); without the numeral Judg 16:5 + 6 t. Judg 16 ; 1Sam 5:8 + 7 t. 1 Samuel; + 1Chr 12:20 (Bear Ginsb ; v. 1Chr 12:19 van d. H. ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5716')\">BDB5716</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5633')\">H5633</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5715')\">BDB5715</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5717')\">BDB5717</entry></div><p> I. [<bdbheb>סֶ֫רֶן</bdbheb>]<sub>21</sub> <b>noun masculine</b> <highlightword>tyrant, lord</highlightword> (Philistine loan-word); — plural absolute <bdbheb>הַסְּרָנִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 16:30\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(7,16,30)\">Judg 16:30</ref> + 2 t.; construct <bdbheb>סַרְנֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 3:3\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(7,3,3)\">Judg 3:3</ref> + 16 t.; suffix <bdbheb>סַרְנֵיכֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 6:4\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(9,6,4)\">1Sam 6:4</ref> — only of <highlight>tyrants, lords</highlight> of the Philistines, five in number <ref ref=\"Judg 3:3\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(7,3,3)\">Judg 3:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 13:3\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(6,13,3)\">Josh 13:3</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('D')\"><reflink>D</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"1Sam 6:16\" b=\"9\" c